id=peridot_audio_props
name=Peridot Audio Props (MiSound ASC)
version=v1.0
versionCode=1
author=varun
description=Restores the vendor/ODM audio props missing on this ROM (MiSound ASC smart-amp, AW882xx monitor, stock gain staging). Fixes low internal-speaker volume on POCO F6 / Redmi Turbo 3 (peridot). Systemless: props applied via resetprop at boot, no files replaced.
